e_tag":"_t","target":"竞技场是一种暴力娱乐方式。\n为了取悦观众，获得财富和荣耀的地方。在那里，有志之士、以前的冒险家和那些受永远战斗之诅咒的人互相厮杀。\n\n你解锁了竞技场，现在你可以创建一个新人物进行新的战役模式：#LIGHT_GREEN#竞技场#WHITE#。\n\n竞技场模式中你将在开阔场地上与多个敌人战斗，为了存活下来，战斗策略至关重要。\n战役特点：#YELLOW#\n- 没有任务、剧情、友善生物或逃生途径：只有你独自面对一切逆境。\n- 这里有一个积分系统，你越快杀死你的对手得分越高，分数可是你向别人夸耀的资本哦！\n- 尽情砍杀吧！\n- 你的冠军将成为竞技场的新主宰，让你可以挑战自己的冠军们！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50ecf32e70e5ea7ed555a4aa1a30e95c152c1c7bdbc194aebe19863b9c607b96","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9428209af05a476e064eaf9fa292f03992450240af09e3c24675061706110c8a","logical_entry_identity":"d126921d4a9de80ba3c3a5b9b609dad7d596d04b68f317870041412fa175005d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Jumpgate","source_tag":"talent name","target":"跃迁之门"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8e202655e491425699eb977104d39711de05f3af6075e86a05fa91c7d081dac6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"942bf1e4689a8cdf2a16a5db1a35eaf25d7aae218059376ecbfbb6a69d6a2e20","logical_entry_identity":"8cf370bfd0134347bb6ceb71235bfae8f8066666f92ce54486f0d502db24aee0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Generic combat oriented techniques.","source_tag":"_t","target":"通用格斗技巧。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5c268aa271838b650c9851166b316524b15cfd3126b1a3e1e2d44ed1e959aa05","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"942d0dd6bc974f411ae72d744cdb6783ecb5b26b39d244c8cd0e4ff1026c87d1","logical_entry_identity":"bcc36777d9f4babb21eb7584b39f9502db09dc1b0e61b51ec81ed302ab14ddc1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and burned on a pyre","source_tag":"_t","target":"并被绑在火刑柱上烧死"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4ae01aecb5961230eb1ded89d8a9ed64f1bb88cf8a39b5cbc661f908bce102f6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"942d2cc5702a05748b19d6c4b61142677f4e95d11c3d81f4dabd2fbfc9b65e1c","logical_entry_identity":"0bf5cb8544b740d9113fe5e96e4d05799a404e5fa6ded6f962ebe5b7de2ff845","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dull-eyed orc","source_tag":"entity name","target":"眼神呆滞的兽人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"56faebcb0f4e5113f10ba3bd20379cd7e035d1468077699a1b4d2361f91930f8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"942de61f3d1aa63fd92abb8d2e6ae666e2aa05e1c3dbcfde30a5a13d576cee8b","logical_entry_identity":"4862c5bc3891f3184720fb296a25cf5deb54e48fc46e0200858e3dde40e52660","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Source#'s rage awakens!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source#的愤怒被激发！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"31e6011145ae2d26e00de77300e9b75d596fd3a4cda6caf35184aefe3e335d87","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"942e17514ea43d44b1f9288487fb3601d3bc22365bba75c4f7a23856e3fbfb14","logical_entry_identity":"c68e9d2dd01e60ea3b64aa3e3cad149859805d31b8f5db84d1fb3e197ef88411","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"What brings an apprentice mage out into the wilds?","source_tag":"_t","target":"你一个法师学徒，怎么会跑到荒野里来？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d55bc256ad29d8984deb3fe629612f7c52aab5b42b631c92ce082020790cfab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"942e960a84085f3d2fe74e1bdb5288671617ddb3d412444949511793d273b18f","logical_entry_identity":"1c2750ab8797f06f44ebf39db144d880037cbe25df5b895c6534ff54c1a528eb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Creator. The God who made this world, He who watched silently as the races fought and burnt the land.\nHe who felt great sorrow for this world. He who shall now shatter the barriers of this world to remake it, only better!\nThe staff has allowed us to drain enough energy from this world to open the portal to the Void and summon Him through!\nIt is already too late. He is coming through as we speak -- it is only a matter of hours!","source_tag":"_t","target":"造物主，创造这个世界的神。他默默注视着各个种族争战不休，将大地付之一炬。\n他为这个世界深感悲痛。如今他将击碎这个世界的屏障，将它重塑得更加美好！\n这根法杖让我们得以从这个世界抽取足够的能量，打开通往虚空的传送门并召唤他降临！\n已经太迟了。就在我们说话的此刻，他正在穿过传送门——只需几个小时！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f8a8be2b77fc63d4fe8ac17f8767ca37af34ed0f81c223d918fb07a7822b523b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"94340c3640ed23a549ee94a8a4741adf2e37be156df64ab60f7d4663e32aa9d0","logical_entry_identity":"a8c58d773fafadf9a694dacac4beda5236d4ae1aea12e00d5866b0e80898aac1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dwarven-steel greatmaul","source_tag":"entity name","target":"矮人钢巨锤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4db634a7bae9862d431528d8eda6859765d7c0ba27f5dd3437d2462fcab1779d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9435815ebb3ae4d2018da71cc9a7a42bc800ff81c0d8b7a902f3ae1443dc3909","logical_entry_identity":"9304e074999362261670020a97ceed413288b120592194bbd0752a0eb36afe55","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Human","source_tag":"birth descriptor name","target":"人类"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"62b212df63b8e8af02e6fd612de4728fc7e51a40de5657cf371fca249da57891","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"94362f63a7dc96b93682a3b94ad1a7005934ec946e80f7897b3da9bb4fadf74f","logical_entry_identity":"582766c5ad4a50fbfdfedb93d384e4ba2f0e0ec960541732a94a71973eebfcc7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The chronomancer known as Solith was renowned across all of Eyal. He always seemed to catch his enemies alone.\nIn the case of opponents who weren't alone, he had to improvise.","source_tag":"_t","target":"时空法师索利斯在马基·埃亚尔的世界中十分有名。他总是抓住了他的敌人落单之时。即使对手不是独自一人，他也能临场发挥。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0660d2efce1b3930fb3309b628acdd5a2920ee693ac8e5275bceb26dad17fb72","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9437028f4ccaa3f85e8dfde8a042f31450bf13c7bdcb799f895c7fe9ee7bf80d","logical_entry_identity":"f23feb1ece1a0f2f47d461e01364fe400c795dd3d0afad2b7a4897321d5f1713","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"<<<The precious seconds fly by, but as you feel your mind breaking and burning you see a strange figure appearing in front of you, it radiates of immense power.>>>\n<<<The strange, amorphous figure in front of you remains completely silent. With a gesture of one of its tendrils, the staff is ripped from your hands. A surge of energy goes through the room as it grips the staff. Then you remember the old myth of the Godslayers. This is none other than a ***Sher'Tul***#{italic}#, and it knows you have been colluding with a god. That alone tells you everything you need to know.>>>\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"<<<宝贵的几秒飞逝而过。就在你感觉心智即将崩溃、燃烧之际，一个散发着无穷威能的奇异身影出现在你面前。>>>\n<<<面前这个奇异而无定形的身影始终一言不发。它挥动一根触须，法杖便从你手中被夺走；当它握住法杖时，一股能量席卷了整个房间。你忽然想起关于弑神者的古老传说：这正是一位 ***夏·图尔***#{italic}#，而它知道你一直在与神明勾结。仅此一点，就足以说明一切。>>>\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b8fcaaef46958aa1c7e4bc66cbd6fba8e7b8685e435c41323992f60abea9684e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"943b37ba33b9d9eca930d3be685c8bc5f31188986be0315d8dc9e9ffe8a026ad","logical_entry_identity":"90b9506a373aa5c78e9c62fe6d729f3f91c02b0db7a9fe3e09da5bb2099663a7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hymn of Detection","source_tag":"talent name","target":"侦测圣诗"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"03ea2ff662baa28533d0e50fc26a4ef33a5f8120911935894bfbe5c81a43c9da","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"943c67d89eb21ed114857f99d5723d8bc77f42150e617035e32c495b98113d82","logical_entry_identity":"f7316c55b816e58fa63503b05c9b5c8c444ae3bf525dbaf71732a0a94cfdf70e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cute little bunny","source_tag":"entity name","target":"可爱的小白兔"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"a2ba24b43a14a25bf0fad29d87652f00ef4635c638232811ceab7af4a7a9f4c6"}}